Constructor: Initializes the memory storage with default settings.
⦁	allocate(size_t size)
Description: Allocates a block of memory of the given size.
⦁	deallocate(void* pointer)
Description: Deallocates a previously allocated block of memory.
⦁	getMemoryUsage() const
Description: Returns the current memory usage.
⦁	clearMemory()
Description: Clears all allocated memory, ensuring that the storage is freed.

